          (<a href="https://quickjpgconverter.com">quickjpgconverter.com</a>) are
          provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. Please read this
          disclaimer carefully before using our services.
        </p>

        <h2>1. No Professional Advice</h2>
        <p>
